Terminals unused in grammar

   '<'
   '>'
   THEN
   WHILE
   FOR_EACH
   LET
   AND
   OR
   NOT
   FUNC
   PROC


Estado 51 conflictos: 1 reducción(ones)/reducción(ones)


Gramática

    0 $accept: aleph $end

    1 aleph: /* vacío */
    2      | aleph stmts EOL

    3 stmts: control
    4      | exp

    5 control: IF '(' cond ')' stmts
    6        | IF '(' cond ')' '{' stmts '}'
    7        | IF '(' cond ')' '{' stmts '}' ELSE '{' stmts '}'

    8 exp: exp UNION exp
    9    | exp INTER exp
   10    | exp DIFF exp
   11    | POP exp
   12    | exp PUSH exp
   13    | CARDINAL exp
   14    | SIZEL exp
   15    | literal_conj
   16    | literal_list
   17    | '(' exp ')'
   18    | ID '=' exp
   19    | ELEM
   20    | ID

   21 cond: exp IN exp

   22 literal_conj: '{' list_elem '}'
   23             | '{' '}'

   24 literal_list: '[' list_elem ']'
   25             | '[' ']'

   26 list_elem: exp ',' list_elem
   27          | exp


